ul morning, you've inherited a shop you barely know how to manage, and it's on the verge of falling to pieces! Will you be able to make your old man proud and make this dinky little shop one of the greats? It would certainly be easier if the shopkeepers next door wouldn't stop picking a fight...", "summary": "Hey! Shopkeeper! Is a shop-keeping Life Sim in a world inspired by all our favorite RPGs! Collect goodies to sell, befriend the locals to gain their aid and renovate your run down shop before it's too late! A comedic, slow paced slice of life story awaits!", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 28, "name": "Business"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hey-shopkeeper", "videos": [{"id": 182975, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "phx0mEr3PoQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=phx0mEr3PoQ", "title": "Hey! Shopkeeper! Steam demo trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/phx0mEr3PoQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}